# Routes 38 and 39 (and the Moomoo Farm and the gate house to Ecruteak): HeartGold gives the farmland west of
# Ecruteak one theme (SEQ_GS_R_6_38), and this game a song of its own: an easy flute in F major over a rolling harp,
# a walking bass and a soft drum, the cows' pasture on the way to the sea. Original composition for this game
# (plan 20 · J8).
